---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import ProcessSteps from "../components/ProcessSteps.astro";
import FAQAccordion from "../components/FAQAccordion.astro";
import CTAForm from "../components/CTAForm.astro";
import aboutPortrait from "../assets/Image_20260509161325_9_79.jpg";
import whatIDoImage from "../assets/WhatsApp Image 2025-03-13 at 2.32.28 PM(6).jpeg";
---

<Layout
	pageTitle="After Dark Studio | Spatial Design for Renters"
	pageDescription="After Dark Studio helps renters in Hong Kong create homes they enjoy coming back to."
	headerTheme="dark"
>
	<Hero />

	<Section id="is-this-you">
		<div class="is-you-strip__inner">
			<div class="is-you-strip__heading-wrap">
				<h2 class="is-you-strip__heading">Is This You?</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="is-you-strip__content">
				<div class="is-you-strip__grid">
					<ul>
						<li>Your dining table is mostly a drop-zone, not for eating</li>
						<li>Your guitar, yoga mat, puzzle, or art supplies technically exist, but your home makes it hard to actually use them</li>
						<li>You've done the “shove everything in one room and close the door” before guests arrive</li>
					</ul>
					<ul>
						<li>Your “video call background” is a tiny corner carefully angled away from the chaos</li>
						<li>You don't want to throw everything out and start over</li>
						<li>You're about to move and want the new place to feel right from day one</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<p class="is-you-strip__closing">If you're mentally ticking a few boxes, you're exactly who I design for.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section id="what-i-do">
		<div class="what-i-do__inner">
			<h2 class="what-i-do__heading">How I Help</h2>
			<div class="what-i-do__container">
				<div class="what-i-do__copy card">
					<h3>Not a "buy everything new" service</h3>
					<p>Most design services start with shopping lists. I start with what you already have.</p>
					<p>My background is in spatial design: understanding how people move through and use a space. Instead of focusing on decoration, I focus on how your home functions day to day, so everyday tasks feel easier and the things you care about have room to happen.</p>
					<p>Together we'll create a home that works for your everyday life. That might mean:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Eating at your dining table instead of using it as storage</li>
						<li>Finding what you need without searching every drawer</li>
						<li>Creating space for hobbies you've stopped doing</li>
						<li>Making guests feel welcome without a frantic cleanup</li>
						<li>Coming home to a space that feels calmer and easier to maintain</li>
					</ul>
					<p>We'll get there by changing how your space works, not by starting over, but by making better use of what you already have.</p>
				</div>
				<figure class="what-i-do__image">
					<img src={whatIDoImage.src} alt="What I actually do - interior design process" />
				</figure>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<ProcessSteps />

	<Section id="investment" title="Investment">
		<div class="site-shell">
			<div class="investment__container">
				<p>I help renters create homes that feel calmer, work harder, and support the life they want to live, whether that's hosting friends, making time for hobbies, working from home, or simply having a place to properly switch off.</p>

				<div class="investment__offers">
					<div class="offer-card">
						<h4>My Whole Flat Feels Off</h4>
						<p>Every surface seems to collect stuff, and no room really feels fully yours. You want the entire flat to feel calmer and more functional.</p>
						<p><strong>Typical investment starts at HKD 5,000</strong></p>
					</div>
					<div class="offer-card">
						<h4>One Room Is Driving Me Mad</h4>
						<p>Maybe it's the living room that never feels quite right, or the bedroom that doesn't help you switch off and rest.</p>
						<p><strong>Typical investment starts at HKD 3,200</strong></p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p>Not sure which option fits? On our free 15-minute Home Fit Call, I'll recommend the right scope for your space and give you a clear quote before you decide.</p>

				<p class="pricing-cta"><a class="button button--primary" href="#ready" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Start with a free 15-minute Home Fit Call</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Section id="about" title="About">
		<div class="about-section__inner">
			<div class="about-section__copy card">
				<h3>I'm Drishti, a spatial designer based in Hong Kong</h3>
				<p>My background is in designing environments that support how people move, interact, and live within a space.</p>
				<p>Over the past 6+ years, I've worked across interior design, scenic design for theatre, installations, and custom-built environments. Whether designing a 7,500 sq ft penthouse, a stage set, or a small rental apartment, I've always been fascinated by the same question:</p>
				<p><strong>How can a space better support the people using it?</strong></p>
				<p>It's the same question that guides my work with renters today. Instead of focusing on decorating or buying more things, I help people make better use of the space they already have, so they spend less time fighting their space and more time enjoying it.</p>
				<p><a class="about-section__link" href="http://drishtichauhandesign.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">See more of my design work here</a></p>
			</div>

			<figure class="about-section__portrait">
				<img src={aboutPortrait.src} alt="Portrait of Drishti" />
			</figure>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<FAQAccordion />

	<Section id="ready" title="Even if the lease is temporary, your life there isn't.">
		<div class="card contact-cta">
			<CTAForm />
		</div>
	</Section>

</Layout>

<style>
	#is-this-you {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-tan);
		--section-border: rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.2);
	}

	#what-i-do {
		--section-bg: var(--bg);
		--section-heading: var(--heading);
		--section-text: var(--text);
		--section-accent: var(--accent-teal);
		--section-border: rgba(31, 41, 51, 0.08);
	}

	.is-you-strip {
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
		padding: 2.5rem 0;
	}

	.is-you-strip__inner {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.is-you-strip__heading-wrap {
		padding-left: 1rem;
	}

	.is-you-strip__content {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.is-you-strip__heading {
		display: inline-block;
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid {
		border-left: 3px solid var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		padding-left: 1rem;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem 2rem;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid ul {
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: 1rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid li {
		line-height: 1.45;
	}

	.is-you-strip__grid li::marker {
		color: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-1));
	}

	.is-you-strip__closing {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__inner {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__heading {
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 68ch;
		color: var(--section-heading, var(--heading));
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
		text-align: left;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.95fr) minmax(340px, 0.8fr);
		column-gap: 4rem;
		align-items: stretch;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	@media (min-width: 861px) {
		.section#what-i-do .section__inner {
			max-width: min(100%, 78rem);
			padding: 0 2rem 0 3rem;
		}

		.section#investment .section__inner {
			max-width: 100%;
			padding: 0 2rem;
		}

		.investment__container {
			max-width: 65%;
			margin-left: auto;
			margin-right: auto;
		}
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__copy {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 44rem;
		align-self: stretch;
		justify-self: stretch;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__copy h3 {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__image {
		margin: 0;
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		overflow: hidden;
		justify-self: end;
		width: 100%;
		align-self: stretch;
	}

	#what-i-do .what-i-do__image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		display: block;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		#what-i-do .what-i-do__inner {
			display: grid;
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		#what-i-do .what-i-do__heading {
			width: calc(100% - 3rem);
			margin-left: auto;
			margin-right: auto;
			text-align: left;
		}

		#what-i-do .what-i-do__container {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
			width: calc(100% - 3rem);
			margin-left: auto;
			margin-right: auto;
		}

		#what-i-do .what-i-do__copy {
			padding: 1.5rem;
			border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
			border: 1px solid var(--section-border-2, rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.35));
			background: var(--section-surface, rgba(255, 250, 244, 0.78));
			box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);
		}

		#what-i-do .what-i-do__image {
			width: 100%;
			margin: 0;
			border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
			overflow: hidden;
		}

		#what-i-do .what-i-do__image img {
			width: 100%;
			height: auto;
			min-height: 0;
			object-fit: cover;
			border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		}

		.is-you-strip__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.about-section__inner,
		.investment__offers {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	#investment .card {
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		border: 1px solid var(--section-border-2, rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.35));
		box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.06);
	}

	#investment p,
	#investment li {
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	#investment .button--primary {
		background: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		color: var(--section-accent-text, var(--bg));
	}

	.about-section {
		background: var(--bg);
		padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
	}

	.about-section__inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 10fr) minmax(260px, 0.85fr);
		gap: 1.25rem;
		align-items: stretch;
		
	}

	.about-section__copy {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--section-bg, var(--bg));
		border: 1px solid var(--section-border-2, rgba(59, 124, 130, 0.28));
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.about-section__copy p {
		margin-top: 1rem;
		color: var(--section-text, var(--text));
	}

	.about-section__link {
		display: inline-flex;
		margin-top: 1.15rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--section-accent-link, var(--accent-teal));
	}

	.about-section__link:hover,
	.about-section__link:focus-visible {
		color: var(--section-accent, var(--accent-tan));
		outline: none;
	}

	.about-section__portrait {
		margin: 0;
		display: grid;
	}

	.about-section__portrait img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		min-height: 340px;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center;
		border-radius: 18px;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.16);
	}

	.investment__container {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: 2rem;
		align-items: center;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.investment__offers {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.offer-card {
		background: #1e293b;
		border: 1px solid #1e293b;
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
		backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
	}

	.offer-card h4 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #f5f0e8;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
	}

	.offer-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: #f5f0e8;
	}

	.offer-card strong {
		color: #c7945c;
	}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
		:global(#what-i-do) .what-i-do__inner {
			display: grid;
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		:global(#what-i-do) .what-i-do__heading {
			width: 100%;
			margin: 0 auto;
			text-align: center;
		}

		:global(#what-i-do) .what-i-do__container {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.25rem;
			width: 100%;
			margin-left: auto;
			margin-right: auto;
		}

		:global(#what-i-do) .what-i-do__copy {
			width: 100%;
			max-width: none;
			padding: 1.5rem;
			border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
			border: 1px solid var(--section-border-2, rgba(199, 148, 92, 0.35));
			background: var(--section-surface, rgba(255, 250, 244, 0.78));
			box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.08);
			box-sizing: border-box;
		}

		:global(#what-i-do) .what-i-do__image {
			width: 100%;
			margin: 0;
			border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
			overflow: hidden;
		}

		:global(#what-i-do) .what-i-do__image img {
			width: 100%;
			height: auto;
			min-height: 0;
			object-fit: cover;
			border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		}
	}
</style>
